        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THREE CRITERIA (all three required):\n  1. Overlapping generations         -- parents + offspring cohabit\n  2. Cooperative brood care          -- workers help raise young not their own\n  3. Reproductive division of labor  -- some individuals forgo own reproduction\n                                        (workers) while others specialize\n                                        (queens, reproductives)"
    },
