      "text": "GRADES OF SOCIALITY:\n  Solitary ---------> Subsocial --> Semisocial --> Primitively eusocial --> Advanced eusocial\n  (no cooperation)   (parent        (castes,       (castes + overlap;       (morphological\n                      feeds young)   same gen)      small colony)            castes; large\n                                                                             colony)"
