      "text": "EUSOCIAL INSECTS:\n  Hymenoptera:  ants (all), many bees, some wasps -- ~20K eusocial spp\n  Blattodea:    termites (all, ~3,500 spp) -- evolved independently\n  Thysanoptera: some gall thrips (Kladothrips) -- unusual case\n  Hemiptera:    aphid soldiers in some species -- partial eusociality\n```"
